--- !u!114 &596097423
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 596097411}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: "I didn\u2019t tell anyone how it happened, or how the sword got into my
      hands, but I had delivered Storm and Master something terribly powerful\u2026
      Something that belongs to me."
    name: Jade
    character: {fileID: 627397545}
    pose: 
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: 
  - text: "I began training for years, for the day I would one day take my revenge.
      But the Master wouldn\u2019t let me have my sword back. He could never understand.
      You could never."
    name: Jade
    character: {fileID: 1377066189}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Surprised
  - text: "You\u2019ve made a big mistake making enemies with me. But I am not cruel
      \u2013 I will not kill you like the original Protectors\u2026 Instead, I will
      give you a choice. Storm, give me Spartan Jack and Chrome Dome, so that I can
      finish what you cannot\u2026 or face my fist."
    name: Jade
    character: {fileID: 1377066189}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Surprised
  - text: Storm, are you really gonna hand me over to this psychotic-- piece of trash--
      backstabbing--
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 627397545}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Angry
  - text: I will not let you kill anyone, Jade. You know you went a step too far
      last night, and I cannot let you put any lives in danger.
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 779853421}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "You said you were a Protector. You have sworn an oath to the Sword \u2013
      let alone me and my family \u2013 and killing has given us nothing but grief"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 779853421}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "You\u2019re wrong \u2013 killing would only be a small hiccup in my quest
      to protect the sword. And the only way we can achieve that is by REMOVING the
      ones that wronged us\u2013 the ones that tried to steal from us, and the ones
      who know our secrets."
    name: Jade
    character: {fileID: 1377066189}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Dissappointed
  - text: "Face it, Storm. You don\u2019t have the GUTS to do what needs to be done.
      That\u2019s why your father was going to give me the blade- he liked me more!"
    name: Jade
    character: {fileID: 1377066189}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Mad
  - text: "IF BEING A RECLKESS KILLING MACHINE IS WHAT HE WANTS, then I am done with
      him and I am HELLA DONE WITH YOU. I\u2019ve had it up to here!"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 779853421}
    pose: Unsheath
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Mad
  - text: "Think, Storm!\nShe's strong here in the spirit world...\nYou don\u2019t
      wanna\u2014"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1114201581}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Mad
  - text: "I believe the INSIDERS are all more of a headache than they\u2019re worth.
      People lie, Storm. They corrupt you. Heck, even my own SISTER threw me off
      a rooftop!"
    name: Jade
    character: {fileID: 1377066189}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Mad
  - text: "She\u2019s trying to tilt you, Storm. Mind games"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1114201581}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "With both the Insiders and the Spartans gone, the Sword will remain inert
      forever\u2026 Yes\u2026 Even if you are not Spartans\u2026 You are all just
      LOOSE ENDS in the GRAND PLAN. And I will be the one to tie you up. The spirit
      world isnt a bad place, I hear. You\u2019ll like it"
    name: Jade
    character: {fileID: 1377066189}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: "What I\u2019m saying is, you have made an enemy of me. I was trying to
      keep my plan a secret, but oh well, the cat is out of the bag. I can feel my
      power growing with every day leading up to the winter solstice in one day,
      where the spirit Chi is at full potency, and on that day, I will be made real"
    name: Jade
    character: {fileID: 1377066189}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Surprised
  - text: "When I lay my hands on that blade, my spirit will be BACK ON EARTH! I\u2019ll
      break into the Vault, take my good friend Khan out for one final spin, and
      put things right. And then I\u2019ll vanish, out of everyone\u2019s hair like
      you always wanted"
    name: Jade
    character: {fileID: 1377066189}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Mad
  - text: (Suddenly, just as soon as she appeared...)
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 627397545}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Mad
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
